[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0010","text":"嗯……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0020","text":"“明天集合是几点来着？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0030","text":"诶，那个……\n好像是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0040","text":"“七点哦！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0050","text":"“是七点。问卷也要记得做完哦”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0060","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0070","text":"哈哈……大家回复都好快啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0080","text":"“大家，雾子好像也有话想说哦”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0090","text":"“今天大家早点睡吧＾＾”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800300_02_0100","text":"『OK』"}]
